  dialogues:
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a523a5270ea15a44c9e29ed2ea57ff8b, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Unlocking the highly unstable cylinders. They\u2019re color-coded
      for your convenience, because apparently, humans need a warning before they
      blow themselves up."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 42540f83218592c47a3447c322947b86, type: 3}
    subtitle: "The red barrel. A classic of the genre. It\u2019s like a universal
      sign for 'shoot here to solve all your problems.'"
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4ff45aab0e820f4dacef3ceb5cc716c, type: 3}
    subtitle: "I\u2019ve added explosive barrels to the inventory. My logic processors
      say they're 'tactically unsound,' but my entertainment sub-routines say 'yes,
      please.\u2019"
